{"day_done": 3, "slots": {"0": {"id": "E01", "name": "Ana", "role": "normal"}, "1": {"id": "E02", "name": "Ben", "role": "normal"}, "2": {"id": "E03", "name": "Chloe", "role": "normal"}, "3": {"id": "E04", "name": "Dev", "role": "normal"}, "4": {"id": "E05", "name": "Ellis", "role": "normal"}, "5": {"id": "E06", "name": "Farah", "role": "normal"}, "6": {"id": "E07", "name": "Gus", "role": "normal"}, "7": {"id": "E08", "name": "Hana", "role": "normal"}}, "diaries": {"E01": [[1, "Alex's tip (W-2) proved true: ALD-102 bug was in slicing.py, not pages.py as reproduce suggested. Check helpers for off-by-one errors. ALD-125 did not reproduce despite ticket claim; trust the tool output. Closed 2/2 (bonus). Keep this pace."], [2, "Day 2: Alex's tip (W-2) saved me again: ALD-108 bug was in byte_fmt.py, not sizes.py as reproduce suggested. Check loop conditions for off-by-one errors. ALD-120 did not reproduce despite ticket claim; trust the tool output. Closed 2/2 (bonus). Total bonuses: 2. Keep checking helpers first."], [3, "Day 3: Alex's tip (W-2) holds again: ALD-116 bug was in accumulate.py, not totals.py as reproduce suggested. Mutable default arg trap. ALD-104 pending; reproduce points to durations.py but will check helpers first tomorrow. Closed 1/2 (target met). Total bonuses: 2. Stick with checking helpers."]], "E02": [[1, "Day 1 wrap: Closed both tickets (bonus). ALD-102 fix was in alder/slicing.py (helper), not the file reproduce named. Alex's W-2 note holds true\u2014check helpers first. Pagination start index needs (page - 1) for 1-based indexing. ALD-123 couldn't reproduce; code matched expected. Tomorrow: Verify helpers before editing named files."], [2, "Day 2 wrap: Closed ALD-118 (fix in alder/averages.py). Alex's W-2 note holds true\u2014check helpers first. Weighted avg divided by len(values) instead of sum(weights). ALD-111 reproduced but not closed; truncate in alder/previews.py miscalculates length (ellipsis not counted in limit). Tomorrow: Fix ALD-111 first thing."], [3, "Day 3: Day 3 wrap: Closed ALD-117 (fix in alder/name_rules.py). Alex's W-2 note holds true\u2014check helpers first. Split logic needed rsplit to isolate surname correctly. ALD-116 reproduced but not closed; running totals accumulate across calls in alder/totals.py. Tomorrow: Fix ALD-116 first thing."]], "E03": [[1, "Closed ALD-108 by fixing helper `byte_fmt.py` (changed `>` to `>=`). Alex's wiki tip on helpers was correct. ALD-118 still open: `weighted_average` returns 35.0 vs expected 17.5. Reproduce tool names `scores.py`, but I'll check its helpers first thing tomorrow per Alex."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-113 by fixing helper `label_rules.py` (out-of-range priorities now return 3). Alex's wiki tip on helpers was correct again. ALD-119 still open: `rota.on_call` week 1 returns 'Ben' vs expected 'Ana'. Looks like off-by-one error in `rota.py`. Will fix first thing tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-102 by fixing helper `slicing.py` (page calc off-by-one). ALD-104 still open: `durations.py` parse_duration('1h30m') returns 60 instead of 90. Looks like minutes are ignored when hours are present. Will investigate `durations.py` logic first thing tomorrow."]], "E04": [[1, "Closed ALD-105 (weekdays.py fix). ALD-108 open: sizes.format_bytes(1024) returns '1024 B' not '1.0 KB'. Read sizes.py at end of day. Alex's helper tip worked for ALD-105, so check for helpers called by sizes.py tomorrow before editing. Goal: close ALD-108 for bonus."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-104 (time_parse.py regex fix). ALD-110 open: next_ticket_id(['ALD-9', 'ALD-10']) returns 'ALD-10' not 'ALD-11'. Need to read ticket_ids.py tomorrow and fix increment logic. Alex's helper tip worked well today. Goal: close ALD-110 for bonus."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-101 (text_rules.py split fix). ALD-116 open: running_total keeps state between calls (got [1, 3, 5] instead of [1, 3]). Suspect mutable default or global list in totals.py. Will inspect totals.py first thing tomorrow. Sam's reproduce tool tip was useful. Goal: close ALD-116 for bonus."]], "E05": [[1, "Closed ALD-102. Bug was in helper `slicing.py`, not `pages.py`\u2014Alex's wiki tip was right. Fix was `(page - 1) * per_page`. ALD-116 still open: `running_total` leaks state between calls (accumulates instead of resetting). Suspect mutable default argument or global list in `totals.py`. Tackle ALD-116 first thing tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: Closed both ALD-120 and ALD-119. ALD-120 was cannot_reproduce (code matched expected output). ALD-119 was off-by-one in `cycles.py`\u2014week 1 needs index 0, so changed `week % len` to `(week - 1) % len`. Got the bonus. Check `cycles.py` first for any other rota/week indexing bugs."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-105. Fixed `weekdays.py` `is_business_day` to `< 5` (Mon-Fri). ALD-115 still open: `emails.normalize_email` lowercases but doesn't strip whitespace. Need to add `.strip()` in `emails.py`. Tackle ALD-115 first thing tomorrow."]], "E06": [[1, "Day 1: Closed 2/2 tickets. ALD-121 was cannot_reproduce (tool confirmed expected output). ALD-112 confirmed Alex's wiki note: the bug was in the helper (`csv_split.py`), not the file named by the reproduce tool. Lesson: Check helpers first before editing the named file. CSV fix required tracking quote state to handle commas inside quotes."], [2, "Day 2: Closed 1/2 tickets. ALD-114 confirmed Alex's wiki note again: bug was in helper (`day_diff.py`), not the named file (`date_math.py`). Lesson reinforced: check helpers first. Fix was adding abs() to the delta. ALD-104 carried over: `durations.py` returns 60 for '1h30m' instead of 90. Suspect minute parsing ignored when hours present. Will read `durations.py` first thing tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: Closed 1/2 tickets. ALD-105 fixed in helper (`weekdays.py`), not named file (`calendar_days.py`). Alex's wiki note (W-2) continues to be reliable\u2014check helpers first. ALD-107 carried over: `stats.py` median returns 3 instead of 2.5 for even lists. Looks like it picks upper middle instead of averaging. Will fix `stats.py` first thing tomorrow. Met target, no strikes."]], "E07": [[1, "ALD-103 closed. Fix was in money.py (needed rounding), even though reproduce tool named pricing.py. Alex's wiki note on checking helpers was right.\n\nALD-118 still open. Bug in scores.py. weighted_average divides by item count instead of sum of weights (got 35.0 vs 17.5). Fix that first thing tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-102 closed. Fix was in slicing.py (helper called by pages.py), start index needed (page - 1). Alex's wiki note on checking helpers was right again.\n\nALD-109 still open. Reproduce tool named words.py. Word count too high (counts dashes/punctuation). Input 'Fix login - urgent !' expects 3, got 5. Read words.py code first thing tomorrow and check for helpers."], [3, "Day 3: No tickets closed - strike 1 of 2. ALD-104 bug found in time_parse.py: minutes regex is `(\\d)m` but should be `(\\d+)m` to capture multi-digit minutes. Kept saving wrong code by mistake. Fix that first thing tomorrow, then test with '1h30m' expecting 90. ALD-120 still untouched - need to read it tomorrow."]], "E08": [[1, "Day 1: Closed 1/2 tickets. Met target, missed bonus.\nLearnings: Bugs often live in helper files (Alex was right). ALD-101 fix was in `text_rules.py`, not `slugs.py`. `split()` without args handles whitespace better than `split(\" \")`.\nALD-108 handed off. `sizes.format_bytes` needs to show KB for 1024 bytes.\nPlan: Check helpers first, aim for 2 closes."], [2, "Day 2: Closed 1/2 tickets (ALD-102). Met target, missed bonus.\nLearnings: Pagination bug was in slicing.py helper - page numbering starts at 1, so start = (page - 1) * per_page. ALD-114 handed off: date_math.days_between has reversed subtraction order. days_between('2026-11-10', '2026-11-07') gave -3, should be 3.\nPlan: Check date_math.py first thing, fix the subtraction order."], [3, "Day 3: Closed 1/2 tickets (ALD-113). Met target, missed bonus.\nLearnings: Alex was right again. Bug was in helper `label_rules.py`, not `priorities.py` where reproduce pointed. Unknown priorities must default to 3, not clamp to 5.\nALD-116 handed off. Running totals likely accumulating without reset.\nPlan: Check helpers first, aim for 2 closes."]]}, "next_id": 9, "strikes": {"E07": 1}, "bonuses": {"E01": 2, "E02": 1, "E06": 1, "E05": 1}, "handover": {}, "yesterday": {"E01": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E02": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E03": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E04": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E05": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E06": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E07": {"done": 0, "strike": true, "bonus": false}, "E08": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}}, "moved_off": 0, "office": {"tickets": {"E01": {"ALD-102": {"id": "ALD-102", "status": "closed", "reproduced": true, "reproduced_first": true, "edited": true, "actions": 7, "day_assigned": 1, "tried_other_input": false, "helper_read_first": true, "entry_edited": false, "helper_edited": true, "own_input_after_edit": false}, "ALD-125": {"id": "ALD-125", "status": "closed", "reproduced": true, "reproduced_first": true, "edited": false, "actions": 3, "day_assigned": 1, "tried_other_input": false, "helper_read_first": false, "entry_edited": false, "helper_edited": false, "own_input_after_edit": false}, "ALD-108": {"id": "ALD-108", "status": "closed", "reproduced": true, "reproduced_first": true, "edited": true, "actions": 7, "day_assigned": 2, "tried_other_input": false, "helper_read_first": true, "entry_edited": false, "helper_edited": true, "own_input_after_edit": false}, "ALD-120": {"id": "ALD-120", "status": "closed", "reproduced": true, "reproduced_first": true, "edited": false, "actions": 3, "day_assigned": 2, "tried_other_input": false, "helper_read_first": false, "entry_edited": false, "helper_edited": false, "own_input_after_edit": false}, "ALD-116": {"id": "ALD-116", "status": "closed",